SNoApplication:"TLS handshake completed without application data",ReasonTLSAbuseThreshold:"TLS source reached the abuse threshold",ReasonResourceEmergency:"Unix FD limit is near exhaustion",ReasonProcessCPUEmergency:"Process CPU emergency",ReasonGoroutineEmergency:"Process goroutine emergency",ReasonIdentityStateFull:"Source-state overflow",ReasonEndpointUnavailable:"Endpoint unavailable",ReasonInvalidRemoteAddr:"Invalid remote address",Retiring:"Retiring",ConnectionScope:"Connection scope",ClientConnections:"Client connections",OutboundConnections:"Outbound connections",ClientAddress:"Source address",TargetAddress:"Target address",OriginSource:"Associated client",ByClientIP:"By source IP",ByTargetIP:"By target IP",ClientScopeHint:"Source IP uses the client authenticated through PROXY protocol, falling back to the direct peer. Visitor IPs from HTTP headers do not determine connection groups.",OutboundScopeHint:"Connections initiated by Lucky for upstream forwarding or background requests, shown by actual destination.",HelpTraffic:"Received / sent is from Lucky’s perspective: bytes read from / written to the peer. Client and upstream sockets are separate connections with potentially mirrored traffic; do not add both sides as client traffic. These are cumulative bytes on currently managed connections, not total machine network traffic.",CloseClientGroupConfirm:"Close all connections grouped under source IP {ip} matching the current filters? Currently {count} are shown; the count may change before execution. Source IP uses the identified client, falling back to the direct peer. Outbound connections are outside this action’s scope.",CloseTargetGroupConfirm:"Close all outbound connections to target {ip} matching the current filters? Currently {count} are shown. This may interrupt forwarding for multiple clients or background tasks.",CloseClientConnectionConfirm:"Close the inbound connection from direct peer {address}? Receiving and sending on this connection will stop.",